sequenceDiagram
    participant Detect as Detection
    participant Ops as Operations
    participant GitHub as Protected Environment
    participant Cloud as Selected provider
    participant Audit as Evidence and audit
    Detect->>Ops: Alert: drift, health, identity, or budget
    Ops->>GitHub: Freeze mutation concurrency
    Ops->>Audit: Preserve logs, state, IDs, hashes
    Ops->>Cloud: Read-only scope and containment
    Ops->>GitHub: Prepare reviewed rollback or corrective proposal
    GitHub-->>Ops: Required reviewer approval
    Ops->>Cloud: Execute exact approved recovery plan
    Cloud-->>Ops: Provider result and health signals
    Ops->>Audit: Verify controls, baseline, root cause, actions
    Audit-->>Ops: Close or escalate with lessons learned
